"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#po-ui-quirks--família-forms--inputs","content":"CSS global em `styles.scss`: `po-decimal input, po-number input \\{ text-align: right; \\}`"},"4380":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-32","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#2-po-input-bottom-padding-misaligns-buttons-8px-offset","content":"**Symptom:** Buttons placed in the same flex row as `po-input` fields appear 8px lower\nthan the visible input field edge, even with `align-items: flex-end` on the container."},"4381":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-33","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#2-po-input-bottom-padding-misaligns-buttons-8px-offset","content":"**Root cause:** `po-input` renders a wrapper that includes an invisible 8px space below\nthe visible input field, reserved for validation error messages. `flex-end` aligns to the\nbottom of this wrapper (including the invisible 8px), not to the bottom of the visible field."},"4382":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-34","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#2-po-input-bottom-padding-misaligns-buttons-8px-offset","content":"**Fix:** Add `margin-bottom: 8px` to the button element or its container."},"4383":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-35","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#4-po-input-p-maxlength-binding-name","content":"**Symptom:** Angular compilation error: `NG8002: Can't bind to 'p-max-length' since it isn't a known property of 'po-input'`."},"4384":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-36","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#4-po-input-p-maxlength-binding-name","content":"**Root cause:** The correct Angular input alias is `p-maxlength` (no hyphen between `max` and `length`)."},"4385":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-37","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"**Symptom:** Binding `(p-value-change)=\"myHandler($event)\"` on `po-dynamic-form` compiles\nwithout errors but the handler is never called, regardless of what the user types."},"4386":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-38","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"**Root cause:** `PoDynamicFormBaseComponent` declares only one `@Output`: `outputs: \\{ formOutput: \"p-form\" \\}`.\nThere is no `p-value-change` output. Angular silently ignores unknown event bindings — no error, no warning."},"4387":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-39","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"**Fix: use `(p-form)` para receber o `NgForm`, depois subscribir em `form.valueChanges`.**"},"4388":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-40","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"**Notas:**"},"4389":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-41","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"`form.valueChanges` dispara a cada tecla em `po-decimal`/`po-number` e no blur em campos texto"},"4390":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-42","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"`[(p-value)]` two-way binding também falha silenciosamente — usar `[p-value]` (one-way) para inicialização e atualizar `headerValues` no subscribe"},"4391":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-43","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#13-po-dynamic-form-p-value-change-não-existe-confirmado-po-ui-v172628","content":"Para `modal-crud`: usar `@ViewChild(PoDynamicFormComponent) dynamicForm` e ler `this.dynamicForm.value` diretamente no save"},"4392":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-44","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Symptom 1 — NG8002 em `[p-current-active-step]`:**"},"4393":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-45","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Symptom 2 — Após clicar \"Anterior\", step visitado permanece marcado como concluído (círculo cheio).**"},"4394":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-46","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Root cause:**"},"4395":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-47","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"`[p-current-active-step]` e `(p-current-active-step)` **não existem** em `po-stepper`"},"4396":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-48","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"O input real é `[p-step]` e o output real é `(p-change-step)`"},"4397":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-49","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"Mesmo usando `[p-step]`, o `po-stepper` avança marcando steps como 'done' mas **não reseta** ao voltar"},"4398":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-50","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Fix:**"},"4399":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-51","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#15-po-stepper-api-incorreta--back-não-reseta-estado-done-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Note:** `PoStepperStatus` não está exportado no public\\_api. Usar `PoStepperItem['status']` como tipo."},"4400":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-52","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#17-po-decimal--po-number-texto-alinhado-à-esquerda-em-formulários-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Symptom:** Campos `type: 'currency'` ou `type: 'number'` em `po-dynamic-form` renderizam o input\ncom texto alinhado à **esquerda** — comportamento oposto ao padrão ERP / Protheus."},"4401":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-53","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#17-po-decimal--po-number-texto-alinhado-à-esquerda-em-formulários-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Root cause:** `po-decimal` não aplica `text-align: right` via CSS interno (v17.26.28)."},"4402":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-54","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#17-po-decimal--po-number-texto-alinhado-à-esquerda-em-formulários-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Fix — adicionar em `src/styles.scss` (uma vez por projeto):**"},"4403":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-55","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#17-po-decimal--po-number-texto-alinhado-à-esquerda-em-formulários-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Não use `::ng-deep`** — `styles.scss` é global, seletores funcionam sem encapsulamento."},"4404":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-56","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#17-po-decimal--po-number-texto-alinhado-à-esquerda-em-formulários-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Afeta:** qualquer `po-dynamic-form` ou `po-dynamic-search` com campos `currency` ou `number`.\nNão afeta `po-table` (que alinha via `type` correto automaticamente)."},"4405":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms-57","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-forms#17-po-decimal--po-number-texto-alinhado-à-esquerda-em-formulários-descoberto-2026-06-26","content":"**Plugin rule:** `styles.scss` gerado pelo plugin inclui essa regra. Ao revisar, verificar se `styles.scss` contém `po-decimal input`."},"4406":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","type":"page","content":"PO-UI Quirks — Família: OnPush / Change Detection","breadcrumbs":["Documentação","Padrões","Padrões"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush"},"4407":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-0","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","content":"Comportamentos relacionados a ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush, sinais e