)`"},"4422":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-15","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#po-ui-quirks--família-onpush--change-detection","content":"12"},"4423":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-16","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#po-ui-quirks--família-onpush--change-detection","content":"po-table"},"4424":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-17","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#po-ui-quirks--família-onpush--change-detection","content":"Tabela invisível no primeiro load em OnPush"},"4425":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-18","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#po-ui-quirks--família-onpush--change-detection","content":"Sempre definir `[p-height]` — sem ele, opacity é async e OnPush não re-renderiza"},"4426":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-19","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#po-ui-quirks--família-onpush--change-detection","content":"14"},"4427":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-20","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#po-ui-quirks--família-onpush--change-detection","content":"PO-UI @Input()"},"4428":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-21","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#po-ui-quirks--família-onpush--change-detection","content":"Signal não é desembrulhada → `[object Object]`"},"4429":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-22","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#po-ui-quirks--família-onpush--change-detection","content":"Chamar sempre com `()`: `[p-items]=\"items()\"` não `[p-items]=\"items\"`"},"4430":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-23","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#po-ui-quirks--família-onpush--change-detection","content":"21"},"4431":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-24","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#po-ui-quirks--família-onpush--change-detection","content":"po-table (detail)"},"4432":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-25","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#po-ui-quirks--família-onpush--change-detection","content":"Linhas de detalhe expandidas invisíveis em OnPush"},"4433":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-26","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#po-ui-quirks--família-onpush--change-detection","content":"`@HostListener('click') onHostClick() \\{ this.cdr.detectChanges(); \\}`"},"4434":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-27","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#1-po-page--content-blank-on-load-onpush--ng-content--updated-2026-06-25","content":"**Symptom:** Navigating via menu click renders the page shell (title, breadcrumb, action\nbuttons) but ALL projected content is invisible — fields, table, filters. Clicking anywhere\ninside the page makes everything appear instantly."},"4435":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-28","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#1-po-page--content-blank-on-load-onpush--ng-content--updated-2026-06-25","content":"**Root cause (two layers):**"},"4436":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-29","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#1-po-page--content-blank-on-load-onpush--ng-content--updated-2026-06-25","content":"`PoPageContentComponent` sets `contentOpacity = 0` on creation and restores it to `1`\ninside a `setTimeout` in its own `ngAfterViewInit`. With **OnPush**, if no CD cycle runs\nafter that setTimeout fires, the opacity change is never applied to the DOM."},"4437":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-30","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#1-po-page--content-blank-on-load-onpush--ng-content--updated-2026-06-25","content":"Broader: `po-page-edit`, `po-page-detail`, and `po-page-list` project content via\n`ng-content`. Their child PO-UI field components (`po-input`, `po-select`, etc.) also\nuse OnPush internally. Without a post-init CD cycle, these children never render their\nvisual content (labels, borders, options)."},"4438":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-31","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#1-po-page--content-blank-on-load-onpush--ng-content--updated-2026-06-25","content":"**Why `markForCheck()` in `ngOnInit` is NOT enough:** `markForCheck()` schedules a check\nfor the *next* CD cycle triggered by Angular's zone. In a route-activated component where\nno zone event fires after init (no HTTP call, no timer, no user interaction), that cycle\nnever arrives. The fields are in the DOM but visually blank until a click event."},"4439":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-32","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#1-po-page--content-blank-on-load-onpush--ng-content--updated-2026-06-25","content":"**Why `detectChanges()` in `ngAfterViewInit` works:** `detectChanges()` is synchronous and\nruns immediately, forcing a full re-render of the component subtree right after all child\nlifecycle hooks have completed (including `po-page-content`'s own `ngAfterViewInit`).\nWrapping it in `setTimeout` pushes it to the next macro-task, after `po-page-content`'s\nown `setTimeout(opacity=1)` has already queued — ensuring correct ordering."},"4440":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-33","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#1-po-page--content-blank-on-load-onpush--ng-content--updated-2026-06-25","content":"**Affects:** Every OnPush component using `po-page-list`, `po-page-edit`, `po-page-detail`,\n`po-page-dynamic-search`, or `po-page-default`. Components making HTTP calls are\n\"accidentally\" safe *only when the response arrives before the user first sees blank*,\nwhich is not guaranteed on slow connections."},"4441":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-34","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#1-po-page--content-blank-on-load-onpush--ng-content--updated-2026-06-25","content":"**Fix — mandatory for every OnPush component using `po-page-*` (already in all plugin templates):**"},"4442":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-35","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"**Symptom:** `po-table` renders correctly in the DOM but is invisible when the page is first\nnavigated to. It only becomes visible after the user moves the mouse or triggers any event.\nThe bug is most noticeable when the table is inside an `@if` block."},"4443":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-36","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"**Root cause (verified against PO-UI source):**"},"4444":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-37","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"`po-table` initialises `tableOpacity = 0`. Two paths to `setTableOpacity(1)`:"},"4445":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-38","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"Path"},"4446":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-39","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"Triggered by"},"4447":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-40","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"Timing"},"4448":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-41","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"`verifyCalculateHeightTableContainer()` → `setTableOpacity(1)`"},"4449":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-42","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"`[p-height]` definido"},"4450":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-43","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"**Síncrono** — mesmo CD cycle"},"4451":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-44","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"`debounceResize()` → `setTimeout(() => setTableOpacity(1))`"},"4452":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-45","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"sem `[p-height]`"},"4453":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-46","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"**Assíncrono** — após o CD cycle"},"4454":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-47","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"Com `OnPush`, o componente já está \"clean\" após o primeiro CD cycle. Quando o `setTimeout` assíncrono\ndispara, Angular não re-checa o componente, então a tabela fica invisível."},"4455":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-48","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"**Fix: sempre definir `[p-height]` em todo `po-table` em componentes OnPush.**"},"4456":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-49","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"Para altura dinâmica (preenche o viewport), usar `computed` signal (ver Quirk #5 em `po-ui-quirks-table.md`):"},"4457":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-50","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#12-po-table-invisible-on-first-load-in-onpush-components-mandatory-p-height","content":"**Regra:** Todo `po-table` em componente `OnPush` DEVE ter `[p-height]`. Sem exceções."},"4458":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-51","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#14-po-ui-input-does-not-auto-unwrap-angular-signals-discovered-2026-06-25","content":"**Symptom:** Binding a `computed<T>()` signal directly to a PO-UI `@Input()` causes the\ncomponent to render `[object Object]` or crash with `Cannot read properties of undefined`."},"4459":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-52","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#14-po-ui-input-does-not-auto-unwrap-angular-signals-discovered-2026-06-25","content":"**Root cause:** Angular's signal auto-unwrapping only works in **Angular-owned template\ncontexts** (built-in directives, Angular's own components with the same signal runtime).\nPO-UI components read `@Input()` values imperatively via `this.breadcrumb.items` inside\ntheir own lifecycle hooks — they receive the Signal function object itself if `()` was omitted."},"4460":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-53","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#14-po-ui-input-does-not-auto-unwrap-angular-signals-discovered-2026-06-25","content":"**Fix:** Always call signals explicitly when binding to PO-UI `@Input()`:"},"4461":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-54","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#14-po-ui-input-does-not-auto-unwrap-angular-signals-discovered-2026-06-25","content":"**Applies to:** ALL PO-UI component `@Input()` bindings when the source is a `signal<T>()` or\n`computed<T>()`. Angular built-in bindings (`*ngIf`, `[class]`, `@for`) DO auto-unwrap and do NOT need `()`."},"4462":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-55","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#14-po-ui-input-does-not-auto-unwrap-angular-signals-discovered-2026-06-25","content":"**Plugin rule:** Every template binding to a PO-UI component must use `signal()` with explicit `()`.\nReviewer must flag any `[p-X]=\"signalProp\"` without `()` as Critical."},"4463":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-56","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#21-po-table-detail-rows-invisible-on-expand-in-onpush-components","content":"**Symptom:** In a `master-detail` component using `po-table` with a `type: 'detail'` column,\nclicking to expand a row shows nothing. The detail rows are in the DOM but have zero height\nor remain invisible. The content appears only after the user clicks elsewhere or triggers\nany zone event."},"4464":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-57","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#21-po-table-detail-rows-invisible-on-expand-in-onpush-components","content":"**Root cause:** `po-table` handles row expansion entirely internally. When the user clicks\nthe expand chevron, `po-table` toggles its internal `showDetails` flag and updates its own\nview — but it does **not** call `markForCheck()` on the parent component. With\n`ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`, the parent component's CD cycle never fires, so Angular\nnever re-renders the projected detail content."},"4465":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-58","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#21-po-table-detail-rows-invisible-on-expand-in-onpush-components","content":"This is distinct from Quirk #1 (page blank on load) and Quirk #12 (table invisible on load)\nbecause it is triggered by a **user interaction event**, not initial render."},"4466":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-59","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#21-po-table-detail-rows-invisible-on-expand-in-onpush-components","content":"**Why the zone event works:** Clicking anywhere else on the host (breadcrumb, filter, other\nrows) triggers Angular's zone, which schedules a global CD pass that picks up the already-\ntoggled detail flag. This is why the content \"appears on the next click.\""},"4467":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-60","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#21-po-table-detail-rows-invisible-on-expand-in-onpush-components","content":"**Affects:** Any `OnPush` component using `po-table` with `type: 'detail'` columns\n(`PoTableDetail`, `master-detail` template pattern, stacked-browse with expandable rows)."},"4468":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-61","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#21-po-table-detail-rows-invisible-on-expand-in-onpush-components","content":"**Fix — add `@HostListener('click')` to call `detectChanges()`:**"},"4469":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-62","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#21-po-table-detail-rows-invisible-on-expand-in-onpush-components","content":"**Why not `markForCheck()`:** `markForCheck()` schedules a future CD pass; if Angular's zone\nnever fires again (no HTTP, no timer after the expand click), the check never runs.\n`detectChanges()` is synchronous and runs immediately."},"4470":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush-63","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-onpush#21-po-table-detail-rows-invisible-on-expand-in-onpush-components","content":"**Plugin rule:** Every `master-detail` component template MUST include `@HostListener('click')`\nwith `cdr.detectChanges()` alongside the `ngAfterViewInit` fix. Both are needed simultaneously."},"4471":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table","type":"page","content":"PO-UI Quirks — Família: po-table","breadcrumbs":["Documentação","Padrões","Padrões"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table"},"4472":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table-0","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table","content":"Comportamentos específicos do componente po-table: seleção, scroll, altura, navegação por teclado,"},"4473":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table-1","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table#po-ui-quirks--família-po-table","content":"PO-UI Quirks — Família: po-table"},"4474":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table-2","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table#3-po-table-horizontal-scroll-in-side-by-side-panels","content":"3\\. po-table horizontal scroll in side-by-side panels"},"4475":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table-3","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table#5-dynamic-table-height-no-page-scroll","content":"5\\. Dynamic table height (no page scroll)"},"4476":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table-4","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table#6-po-table-selection-no-p-selected-rows-output","content":"6\\. po-table selection: no `p-selected-rows` output"},"4477":{"id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table-5","page_id":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/padroes/po-ui-quirks-table#7-po-table-frozen-c